<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('layout-partials/head', { title: 'How it works' }) %>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page-bg">
    <div class="page-bg__blob page-bg__blob--1"></div>
    <div class="page-bg__blob page-bg__blob--2"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <%- include('layout-partials/nav') %>

    <section class="section" style="text-align: center;">
      <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
      <h1>From an idea to an answer in four steps.</h1>
      <p style="max-width: 480px; margin: 10px auto 0;">No account, no app to install for either of you. Just a link that plays a game and asks a question.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section-tight">
      <div class="steps steps--rail" data-reveal-stagger>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step__marker">01</div>
          <h3>Pick a game</h3>
          <p>Choose from the bank, or ask for something custom built.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step step--brown">
          <div class="step__marker">02</div>
          <h3>Write your question</h3>
          <p>Happy birthday, will you marry me, did you get the job. Anything you actually want to know.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step step--black">
          <div class="step__marker">03</div>
          <h3>Share the link</h3>
          <p>Send it to whoever you want to ask. It stays live for a month.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step__marker">04</div>
          <h3>Get the answer</h3>
          <p>The moment they play it and answer, it lands in your inbox.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-tight" id="ideas">
      <div data-reveal style="text-align: center;">
        <p class="eyebrow">Not sure what to ask</p>
        <h2>Steal one of these.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="idea-chips" data-reveal-stagger>
        <a href="/games" class="idea-chip">Pizza or sushi tonight?</a>
        <a href="/games" class="idea-chip">Where should we go this weekend?</a>
        <a href="/games" class="idea-chip">What should we name the puppy?</a>
        <a href="/games" class="idea-chip">Beach or mountains for the trip?</a>
        <a href="/games" class="idea-chip">What's for your birthday dinner?</a>
        <a href="/games" class="idea-chip">Should we finally get that tattoo?</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-tight" style="text-align: center;" data-reveal>
      <h2 style="font-size: 24px;">Got your question? Let's go.</h2>
      <div class="hero__actions" style="margin-top: 16px;">
        <a href="/games" class="btn btn-primary">Browse games</a>
        <a href="/demo" class="btn btn-secondary">Try a demo first</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <%- include('layout-partials/footer') %>
  </div>

  <script src="/js/reveal.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
